<p>The start of the school year is creeping up on us but it is still summer.<span id="more-58034"></span></p>
<p>If you can, find some time to relax in the sun, perhaps by a pool or ocean, enjoy a tropical drink, and enjoy the following guest post.</p>
<p>It&#8217;s by <a href="https://www.nglaskowski.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Nick Laskowski</a> (University of Maryland), who provides us with a seasonal example of the time-honored tradition of philosophers overthinking song lyrics.</p>
